OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785851302
OL,3,CMurder investigation launched after
OL,4,Cman dies
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched and two men have been
OL,8,Farrested after a man died in Wigan,
OL,9,FGreater Manchester.
OL,11,FPolice were called to an address in
OL,12,FInce on Friday 31 July at around
OL,13,F10.35pm where a man had blood coming
OL,14,Ffrom his face.
OL,16,FHe refused medical care at the address
OL,17,Fon Bryn Street, saying he did not
OL,18,Fremember how he got his injuries and
OL,19,Fwould take himself to the hospital in
OL,20,Fthe morning.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
