OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785851302
OL,3,CMurder investigation launched after
OL,4,Cman dies
OL,6,FAt around midday on Saturday 1 August,
OL,7,Fthe victim was in a life-threatening
OL,8,Fcondition at Salford Royal Hospital.
OL,9,FHe died the next day.
OL,11,FTwo men - one in his 50s and another
OL,12,Fin his 30s ` have been arrested on
OL,13,Fsuspicion of murder and remain in
OL,14,Fpolice custody for questioning.
OL,16,FThe victim has been named as 56-year-
OL,17,Fold Brian Cunliffe.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
