OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785851302
OL,3,CMurder investigation launched after
OL,4,Cman dies
OL,6,FDetective Inspector Hulston from
OL,7,FGreater Manchester Police said: "I
OL,8,Fwould like to express my deepest
OL,9,Fcondolences to the family of the
OL,10,Fdeceased during this incredibly
OL,11,Fdifficult time, our Family Liaison
OL,12,FOfficers are supporting the family of
OL,13,Fthe deceased, and we are ensuring they
OL,14,Fare fully updated throughout.
OL,16,F"We are continuing to establish the
OL,17,Ffull facts of this incident, but we
OL,18,Fbelieve both suspects and the victim
OL,19,Fwere known to each other. I would like
OL,20,Fto reassure the community in Wigan
OL,21,Fthat this is an isolated incident.
